 represent  real people and the diversity that we  find in the world  properly and still you know maintain  that  good versus bad all the all the story  time that they do  in wrestling do you think that um  we'll be able to see more diversity of  characters and stories  uh within the wrestling ring or do you  think that that's still kind of far  off i don't think it's too far off  wrestling's come  so far since i retired and i've kind of  been peeking in  here and there and it's already changed  it used to be around my time we had a  shift  for where we had these giant really  larger-than-life characters we're  talking  over six feet tall giant bodybuilders  crazy looks to not quite  as gargantuan i guess you could say  and so what i think is happening is that  we're seeing the fans and the audience  being able to relate more and put  themselves  in those shoes and go gosh i could i  could do that someday i'm really  holding on and i'm latching on to these  stories so the short answer is i  absolutely think that you head that way  very soon and see some very  very relatable story lines and very  relatable characters  yeah we're already seeing a lot of that  i watch a lot too so we're seeing a lot  of that sony kisses there  lots of lots of different characters  that represent so i i'm  i'm on board for that i love that do you  do you ever see a moment in your future  where you might return to  the wrangler is that in your past my  wrestling days are definitely i don't  see  myself taking bumps in the ring or  anything like that i  i do we left on great terms triple h and  i had a conversation he called me  after i had left and he just basically  said hey i understand you want to go be  a father  i get it he was a dad too and he said  the door is always open so  i would never be opposed if they wanted  to do something with me  just an appearance or whatnot because i  love love the wrestling  i love being out in the arenas and  looking at the audience  it's such a rush and it's just such an  amazing opportunity so  i don't think i'd ever wrestle again but  if they offered i'd love to  just go do an appearance or say hi or do  something
 

